sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Server as FastAPI Server<br/>8321/TCP
    participant Auth as AuthenticationMiddleware<br/>ASGI
    participant Quota as QuotaMiddleware
    participant Version as ClientVersionMiddleware
    participant Router as InferenceRouter
    participant RT as CommonRoutingTableImpl<br/>ABAC
    participant Provider as Backend Provider<br/>(OpenAI/Cerebras/NVIDIA/vLLM)
    participant OAuth2 as OAuth2/OIDC Endpoint<br/>JWKS or Introspection

    Note over Client,OAuth2: Inference Request Flow

    Client->>Server: POST /inference/...<br/>Header: Authorization: Bearer <token><br/>Header: x-llamastack-client-version
    Server->>Auth: Forward request

    alt Auth enabled (config.server.auth)
        alt OAuth2 provider (JWT/JWKS mode)
            Auth->>OAuth2: Fetch JWKS keys<br/>(cached, recheck every 3600s)
            OAuth2-->>Auth: Public keys
            Auth->>Auth: Validate JWT signature & claims
        else OAuth2 provider (Introspection mode)
            Auth->>OAuth2: POST /introspect<br/>client_id + client_secret
            OAuth2-->>Auth: Token metadata
        else Custom provider
            Auth->>OAuth2: Forward bearer token +<br/>request context to external endpoint
            OAuth2-->>Auth: Auth decision
        end
        Auth->>Auth: Map claims to attributes<br/>(sub->roles, groups->teams,<br/>project->projects, tenant->namespaces)
    end

    Auth->>Quota: Authenticated request + attributes
    Quota->>Quota: Check rate limits<br/>(separate thresholds:<br/>authenticated vs anonymous)
    Quota->>Version: Forward request
    Version->>Version: Validate client major.minor<br/>matches server version
    Version->>Router: Route to inference handler

    Router->>RT: Resolve provider for model identity
    RT->>RT: ABAC check: is_action_allowed<br/>(read operation on model resource)
    RT-->>Router: Provider reference + routing info

    Router->>Provider: Forward inference request<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    Provider-->>Router: Inference response<br/>(streaming or batch)
    Router-->>Server: Response
    Server-->>Client: JSON/SSE Response

    Note over Client,OAuth2: Agent Session Flow

    participant AgentPersist as AgentPersistence<br/>KV Store

    Client->>Server: POST /agents/session/create
    Server->>Auth: Authenticate
    Auth-->>Server: User attributes
    Server->>AgentPersist: Create session<br/>Key: session:{agent_id}:{session_id}
    AgentPersist->>AgentPersist: ABAC check: is_action_allowed<br/>(create operation)
    AgentPersist->>AgentPersist: Record session ownership<br/>(authenticated user)
    AgentPersist-->>Server: Session created
    Server-->>Client: Session ID

    Client->>Server: GET /agents/session/{id}
    Server->>Auth: Authenticate
    Auth-->>Server: User attributes
    Server->>AgentPersist: Read session
    AgentPersist->>AgentPersist: ABAC check: is_action_allowed<br/>(read, verify ownership)
    AgentPersist-->>Server: Session data
    Server-->>Client: Session response
